WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.020
What a great morning!

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.560
You're up early, Kusaka-kun.

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:09.230
Yo.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.220
I just woke right up this morning.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:14.440
Konoha-chan, good morning!

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:17.740
G-Good morning...

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.920
You're up early. Are you going out for a walk?

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:22.560
Y-Yes...

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.800
All right, guys, three more laps to go!

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:20.870
You can do it! Show me your spirit!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:25.660
Each player's condition is different and changes day by day!

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:29.720
It would be more logical that we only train as much as our current physical condition enables us!

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:30.820
Huh?!

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.340
I think what Manabe-kun says is right...

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:35.800
But only on this.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.170
That sounded like a rather stinging remark.

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:40.130
Oh, was it?

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:47.460
I really suggest... that it would be in your best interests not to... overwork yourself!

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:51.790
Y-You look to me... like you need to hang back and catch a breath!

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:53.120
Say that again?!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.980
What!

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.300
What are those guys doing?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.990
Absolutely no idea.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.740
They're all so motivated!

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:04.920
Yeah.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.670
They had me worried at the beginning, but...

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:09.030
Tenma.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:09.460
Yes?

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.170
We're missing one person.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.920
Look harder.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:21.900
Konoha isn't here.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.970
Now that you mention it, she wasn't here for breakfast either.

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.930
Then, she never came back?

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.290
You know where she is?

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:30.240
Yeah.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.350
I met her in front of the boardinghouse this morning.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.150
She said she was going out for a walk.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.110
A walk... Do you mean Morimura-san?

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:44.240
She's probably at the park.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.530
She's usually around there during free time.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.710
I bet she wanted to be alone.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:57.710
Morimura-san loves animals, so I've often seen her play with the stray cats in the park.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:03:59.930
But maybe something's wrong?

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.050
She's always been prompt about attending practice before.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:08.220
She seemed pretty pressured about whether it was okay for her to stay on this team or not.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.640
I'll go look for her!

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:15.840
Tenma, you keep practicing.

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:19.640
The semifinals are close, so leave this to me.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:20.860
Okay then.

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.360
I'm counting on you to find Konoha.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:24.940
Okay.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:33.370
I wonder if Konoha staying on this team is best for her...

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.550
Does it taste good?

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.900
I see. Thank goodness.

00:04:50.570 --> 00:04:52.810
You all must be really hungry.

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.470
Here you are.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:00.190
We were all worried about you.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.860
I'm sorry...

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:10.830
Hey, it's okay! Don't worry about it that much!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:22.210
Um...

00:05:24.570 --> 00:05:26.230
It's nothing...

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:30.970
Do you like cats?

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.430
I see.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.930
Konoha-chan.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:36.980
Y-Yes?

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:40.690
If there's something troubling you, you can tell me.

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:43.830
I might not look the part, but I am your manager.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.900
Konoha-chan, what's wrong?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:51.450
If I tell you... what will you do with that information?

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:54.060
What will I do?

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.710
Well...

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.440
You're planning to turn me into a joke, aren't you?

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.380
N-No way!

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.210
I-I'm sorry...

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:07.670
Konoha-chan...

00:06:11.220 --> 00:06:12.280
I'm sorry!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:18.500
Konoha-chan...

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.240
Oh? A letter?

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.530
This is terrible!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.950
Konoha isn't coming back to the boardinghouse?

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.870
It surprised me so much!

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.750
I hope that child is okay!

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.610
Excuse me, can I have a look?

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:51.320
"I'm not confident that I can stay here in Inazuma Japan. Konoha."

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:56.860
When I talked with her at the park, I should have brought her back...

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:58.750
It's not your fault, Aoi-san.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.240
That's right.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.190
Morimura is troubled.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:07.440
She's convinced herself that she's a burden to the team.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.870
If we don't do something, she might quit.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:17.160
Maybe we should just let her.

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.370
Konoha is really shy...

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.670
And it seemed hard for her to play soccer in front of the entire stadium.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:27.590
Yes, the weight of representing Japan may be too heavy for her.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.560
She doesn't have an aggressive bone in her body.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:37.600
I don't think her gentle nature is a good match for a competitive sport like soccer.

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.560
None of you understand anything.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:46.520
What do you mean?

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:49.420
She's amazing.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:53.780
She saw with just one look that I wasn't facing myself.

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:58.620
Maybe what Morimura really does want to do is play soccer.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:00.330
Kusaka.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.540
I think I can understand.

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:08.130
What's shutting her off from the rest of the world is what shut me off, too.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:11.880
It's like she can't face herself.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.840
I'll go look for her.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.150
I mean, she even left a note.

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.970
If she wants to come back but can't, that would be sad.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.130
I'll go, too!

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:24.420
Our match is soon, so the rest of you should continue with practice.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:26.480
No, I'll come too.

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.290
Okay, let's go!

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.480
Yeah!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:32.610
Mizukawa-san.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.370
Morimura Konoha is terribly afraid of people...

00:08:36.370 --> 00:08:38.100
Especially girls.

00:08:38.690 --> 00:08:40.620
That includes you.

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:46.120
As her manager, should you not have realized that?

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.920
She's... afraid of girls?

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:15.400
They should just leave her alone...

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:22.200
Mach Tiger's Kaolan gets through the mass of defenders on the right side!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:26.920
Kaolan, with his combination play with Bark, makes a magnificent centering to Tamugan!

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:31.590
Goal!

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.590
Tamugan makes a splendid goal!

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:34.590
I knew it.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.210
Aren't you going to search for her?

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:47.760
Even if I did find Morimura-san, my words won't persuade her.

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:49.310
That's what I have determined.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.290
I see.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.530
You thought the same, didn't you?

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.610
Because it's her own shell that she's trapped in.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.210
Is that Mach Tiger's previous match?

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.830
You look as if you've found something interesting.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.260
Yes.

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:07.610
It's still a hypothesis, but...

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:13.590
About Konoha...

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.340
What do you think about her, Shindou-san?

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:20.150
Coach chose her for Inazuma Japan.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:21.090
Therefore...

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.560
He must have some reason for doing so.

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:31.210
But whatever that reason is, I have no idea.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:33.440
But, with Tenma...

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.690
I'm sure that with Tenma, things will work out somehow.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:44.790
Did you find her?

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:51.590
Tenma, can you think of a place where Konoha-chan may be?

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:57.300
Now that I think about it, I never really talked to her much...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:02.610
Yeah... I don't know anything about Konoha-chan either...

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.140
I should have been more active about talking to her.

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:09.640
Maybe I fail as a manager...

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:15.250
If you're going to say that, then I fail as Captain...

00:11:16.370 --> 00:11:20.900
In any case, it doesn't matter where, let's try to remember a place where she might go.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.900
I-I'm sorry...

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:26.550
You're not hurt?

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.410
Y-Yes...

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.460
Here, your carrots.

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:32.510
Are you on an errand?

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:33.660
What a big girl.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:37.370
No, I'm going to give food to the donkeys.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.000
Donkeys?

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.660
They have donkeys over there!

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:41.930
Bunnies, too!

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:45.660
The donkeys are hungry, so I'm going now!

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:46.510
Bye-bye!

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:50.890
The zoo!

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:02.860
You have so many friends.

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:08.940
Even after I quit soccer, I'll still come to visit.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:14.010
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:19.270
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:31.560
Konoha-chan!

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:34.240
You're right!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.110
Thank goodness!

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:35.770
Yeah.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:41.840
Hey, Kusaka.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.490
Yes?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:48.490
Maybe it would be easier for her to talk to another girl like Aoi, rather than to us.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.010
You have a point.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:52.810
I can't.

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:57.780
I heard that Konoha-chan is afraid of girls.

00:12:58.170 --> 00:12:58.840
Why?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:00.300
I don't know.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:05.010
Maybe she has bad memories with them.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:14.960
You really like animals.

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:16.810
Captain!

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:18.610
I like animals too.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:21.190
I have a dog at home.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.820
He's called Sasuke.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.610
Since he's pretty old now, all he does is stretch out and sleep all day.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:30.080
But that's what's cute about him.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.830
That's different from me.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.120
Animals don't insult you, or look at you weirdly.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:41.460
They don't judge you on whether or not you look cute.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:42.630
Konoha...

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:50.270
Would you mind telling me, um, about what it is you've gone through?

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:54.850
I want to know everything about my teammates, as your captain.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:59.430
If there's something on your mind that's troubling you, I'll help.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:06.490
Everyone says that when they look at me... it irritates them...

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:12.620
That's why I kept myself from talking to anyone else...

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.810
But then that also irritates them...

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.160
Konoha...

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:22.710
When you look at me, do you get irritated too?

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:24.940
Of course not!

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:29.740
My face irritates everyone...

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:32.870
I was bullied because of it.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.730
She said it was my fault for having a face that irritates her.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:43.960
There's no one who looks at you and thinks that way, not me or anyone else on the team!

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:49.560
Maybe not now, but the longer we're together...

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:51.920
Konoha...

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:57.410
I still don't know why Coach chose me...

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:01.150
Oh, for crying out loud! I can't stand this anymore!

00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:02.080
Hey, wait!

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:07.100
That's why someone like me-

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.380
Hey!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.160
Quit blabbing nonsense and trust us!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.050
Kusaka-kun...

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.730
None of us hate you!

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:18.560
You're one of us! You're a member of Inazuma Japan!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:26.010
It was you who told me...!

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.450
That I was scared.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.260
But that goes for you, too.

00:15:34.260 --> 00:15:36.450
You're scared stiff!

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:41.350
That's why I could tell you were the same as me.

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:45.140
Then face it! That's what <i>I</i>  did!

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.000
Come on!

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:51.330
I can't...

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:52.970
You <i>can!</i>

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.730
It's thanks to you that I...

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:58.250
I'm not scared of anything anymore!

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:02.650
I'm different from you, Kusaka-kun...

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.510
That kind of attitude is really irritating!

00:16:07.510 --> 00:16:08.900
Kusaka!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:10.850
Irritating...

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:13.610
I knew it...

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:17.090
Konoha!

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.490
I'll try talking to her again!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.070
Damn me.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:28.860
Goal!

00:16:28.860 --> 00:16:31.930
Tamugan makes a splendid goal!

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.110
That's the play he made after the tournament began.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.950
I can tell that much on my own, thanks.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.930
Then take a look at this.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.350
This is from one of Mach Tiger's matches before the tournament.

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.750
Kaolan gets through the defender on the right side!

00:16:44.750 --> 00:16:46.520
He makes a one-two pass to Bark and makes a centering!

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:49.510
Goal!

00:16:49.510 --> 00:16:53.660
I chose a similar play for comparison, so can you tell the difference?

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:56.140
There <i>is</i>  something different about it, but...

00:16:56.510 --> 00:17:01.020
Here's the data on Tamugan, Mach Tiger's forward, before the tournament.

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:05.180
Here, I overlap this with his data after the tournament began.

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:12.760
His speed, pass success rate, shooting power, and all other components are far more superior than before.

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.510
It's like he's a whole other person...

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.470
Now take a look at the other players' data.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:22.970
All of their data contain drastically increased values compared to their data from before the tournament began.

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:26.170
You're right... It's not ordinary...

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:32.480
And if this was also the case, not only for Mach Tiger, but for all of the other teams...

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.410
What would you make of it?

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:38.470
This is Big Waves.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.470
Fire Dragon.

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:47.170
Could we have just uncovered something really big...?

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:01.470
There she is!

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.480
Konoha-chan!

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:04.180
Morimura!

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:08.180
I knew it... I irritate everyone...

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:16.740
Kitty?

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:22.450
Don't cross! You'll get run over!

00:18:28.150 --> 00:18:29.170
L-Look!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:29.830
That cat!

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:32.540
Kitty!

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:34.820
Kitty!

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:35.390
Watch out!

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:36.060
Stop!

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:36.760
Konoha-chan!

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.160
I...

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:01.870
What just happened...?

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:07.030
Don't jump out into the street again.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.190
Are you okay, Konoha?!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:12.880
Konoha-chan!

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.190
Konoha, what you just did...

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:17.010
Those were some moves!

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:20.800
Konoha-chan.

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:26.540
I'm sorry about not realizing before now how hard it felt for you to talk to me.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.470
N-No way...

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:33.650
I promise you, Konoha-chan, that I will never betray you.

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:38.460
I'm not asking you to trust me right away.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:42.350
But why don't you try playing soccer again with everyone one more time?

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:43.670
Yeah!

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:45.280
You've come so far!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:49.380
Come fight with us against Mach Tiger and give it everything you have!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:54.930
If you quit now, you won't play soccer again, won't you?

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:58.130
I want you to love soccer!

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.090
Think of it as a favor to me, too.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:05.480
How you moved just now... It blew my mind!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:09.160
With that, you'll definitely be a match for the strongest in the world.

00:20:21.310 --> 00:20:22.390
Matatagi!

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:23.450
Leave it to me!

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.330
I see you managed to persuade her.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.290
There was no persuading involved.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:34.790
Morimura!

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:47.160
Are you okay?

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:48.850
Yes...

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:53.390
All right, let's continue!

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:56.080
Put your backs into it!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:59.610
If we put too much of our backs into it before the actual game, we'll suffer backaches.

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:04.110
What? You're still unwilling to put in effort this late in the tournament?!

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:08.110
I don't call it being unwilling. I call it reserving my strength.

00:21:08.110 --> 00:21:10.490
Huh?! What you need here is spirit!

00:21:13.730 --> 00:21:19.920
Some amongst them are beginning to catch on to the mysteries of this tournament.

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:22.420
What do you intend to do about that?

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:54.850
All right, guys, let's go!

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:59.760
The new sports drink for everyone, Guts Gear Water, is on sale!

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:03.570
Amino Vital is holding a drink-and-win campaign right now!

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:09.700
With the codes you send us from the appropriate merchandise, enter to win either a soccer ball signed by FC Tokyo's team...

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:13.930
...or the Inazuma Eleven GO DVD triple box!

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:15.950
Even if you don't win, you're eligible to win this other prize!

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:17.930
We're waiting for your raffle entries!

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:20.440
For more info, search "Amino Vital" on the web!

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:22.880
Eat well, live well.

00:23:24.210 --> 00:23:27.730
Our opponent for the semifinals is Thailand's Mach Tiger!

00:23:27.730 --> 00:23:29.710
Their muay thai action cuts in!

00:23:29.710 --> 00:23:32.050
Within the fierce clash, Kusaka roars!

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:34.220
Next, Confession On the Field!

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:36.230
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:49.580
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:52.350 --> 00:23:55.640
Quit blabbing nonsense and trust us!

00:23:55.640 --> 00:23:56.720
That's all!
